{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114000919194-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114001203\"/><p>天文台料未來數小時本港雨勢有時頗大。</p><p>天文台於今日(14日)凌晨零時發出特別天氣提示，指現時位於珠江口以西及香港以南海域的雨區正逐漸靠近，預料未來數小時本港雨勢有時頗大。市民請留意天氣變化。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.717155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T16:09:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:54.110041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:54.110041+00:00","content_hash":"b47645b684e10ebd47f71382b6a21557455b2d6cdbfc1c15a886a5d0396b7cf9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}